  "faq_q1": "What is the GS Track app?",
  "faq_a1": "GS Track is an internal app from GS Battery to manage administrative tasks such as leave, reimbursement, permission to leave work, and external duties.",
  "faq_q2": "Who can use GS Track?",
  "faq_a2": "All GS Battery employees with login access can use the app.",
  "faq_q3": "Can I use GS Track on mobile devices?",
  "faq_a3": "Yes, GS Track is available for Android and iOS.",
  "faq_q4": "How do I apply for leave?",
  "faq_a4": "Go to the Leave menu, choose the type, input the dates and reason, upload documents if needed, then click submit.",
  "faq_q5": "What types of leave are available?",
  "faq_a5": "Annual leave, sick leave, marriage leave, maternity leave, and others as per company policy.",
  "faq_q6": "Can I cancel my leave application?",
  "faq_a6": "Leave applications that haven’t been approved can be canceled via the leave history page.",
  "faq_q7": "How long does leave approval take?",
  "faq_a7": "Usually takes 1–2 business days depending on your supervisor.",
  "faq_q8": "What is the Reimbursement feature?",
  "faq_a8": "It allows you to claim work-related expenses such as transport or meals.",
  "faq_q9": "What documents are needed for reimbursement?",
  "faq_a9": "Upload receipts, invoices, or payment proof.",
  "faq_q10": "How long is the reimbursement process?",
  "faq_a10": "It usually takes 3–5 business days after verification.",
  "faq_q11": "What is Permission to Leave Work (IMP)?",
  "faq_a11": "Permission to leave your workplace temporarily during work hours.",
  "faq_q12": "Do I need to state the reason for IMP?",
  "faq_a12": "Yes, include reason, departure time, and estimated return.",
  "faq_q13": "What is External Duty?",
  "faq_a13": "Work conducted outside the office such as client visits.",
  "faq_q14": "What's the difference between IMP and External Duty?",
  "faq_a14": "IMP is for personal matters, External Duty is for official tasks.",
  "faq_q15": "What file formats can I upload?",
  "faq_a15": "JPG, PNG, and PDF. Max size depends on company policy.",
  "faq_q16": "How can I view uploaded attachments?",
  "faq_a16": "From the submission detail page. Images show directly, PDFs open in viewer.",
  "faq_q17": "How do I know if my request is approved or rejected?",
  "faq_a17": "You’ll get a notification. You can also check the status in your history.",
  "faq_q18": "What do 'Pending', 'Approved', and 'Rejected' mean?",
  "faq_a18": "Pending = waiting for approval, Approved = accepted, Rejected = not approved.",
